おにょーん…ここ通れる道路なんじゃ？ま、この辺か。よいしょ！
Oñoooon... Wait, is this a road you can drive through? Well, around here then. Here goes!

368
00:30:02,008 --> 00:30:03,908
ああー！
Aaaah!

369
